# Digital Wall Clock 🕒

A simple and attractive digital wall clock created using Java Swing.

## Features

- Displays current time
- Shows date and day
- Updates automatically every second
- Attractive dark-themed interface
- Simple and easy-to-use design

## Technologies Used

- Java
- Java Swing
- AWT
- SimpleDateFormat

## How It Works

The application uses Java Swing to create the graphical interface.
A Timer updates the displayed time every second using the current system date and time.

## Project

This project helped me understand Swing components, layouts, labels, colors, fonts and timer-based updates in Java.
